  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\nBODMAS Rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c49e9ef184ad3a244b4a0e325f1c03fdf73a234e5d04e86e969336de19771c93.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n 9 of {(4 ÷ 2) × [2 - (4 of 6 ÷ 2)] + (6 × 1 ÷ 3)} - 5.\n\n⇒ 9 of {(2) × [2 - (4 × 6 / 2)] +(6/3)} - 5 \n\n⇒ 9 × {(2) × [2 - (24 / 2)] +2} - 5 \n\n⇒ 9 × {(2) × [2 - 12] +2} - 5 \n\n⇒ 9 × {(2) × -10 +2} - 5 \n\n⇒ 9 × {-20 +2} - 5 \n\n⇒ 9 × (-18) - 5 \n\n⇒ -162 - 5 \n\n⇒ -167 \n\n**∴ The value is -167**\n\n1e8",
